{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Give.</b> The prophet prays after the decree upon them that each one bring his children out to the slayer — perhaps the little ones will die and their suffering not be great. And this is \"give a miscarrying womb\" — that they die in the womb, and the newborns die for lack of milk." "<b>They wither.</b> Like dried shriveled figs."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:43.552652128Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}